"Xenra is an emulator frontend for running Xbox software on iOS.\n\nXenra is an open-source project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft in any way. This project is intended for educational and research purposes as we continue developing and porting the emulator to iOS." = "Xenra 是用于在 iOS 上运行 Xbox 软件的模拟器前端。\n\nXenra 是一个开源项目，与 Microsoft 没有任何关联，也未获得其认可。在我们继续开发模拟器并将其移植到 iOS 的过程中，本项目仅用于教育和研究目的。";
"⚠ Legal Notice" = "⚠ 法律声明";
"We do not condone piracy. BIOS files and game backups must be legally owned. While emulator software itself is legal, downloading or distributing copyrighted BIOS files or games without ownership is illegal. Please be responsible and cautious online." = "我们不纵容盗版。BIOS 文件和游戏备份必须合法拥有。虽然模拟器软件本身是合法的，但下载或分发未经授权的受版权保护的 BIOS 文件或游戏是非法的。请在网上保持负责任和谨慎的态度。";
"Privacy policy" = "隐私政策";
"Tap to choose" = "点击选择";
"Check this" = "请检查";
"Ready" = "就绪";
"Not set" = "未设置";
"Games need JIT, which iOS only allows while a debugger tool has attached to Xenra. That takes two things: an install signed with a development certificate, and JIT enabled for Xenra in StikDebug." = "游戏需要 JIT，而 iOS 只在调试工具附加到 Xenra 时才允许 JIT。这需要两点：使用开发证书签名的安装，以及在 StikDebug 中为 Xenra 启用 JIT。";
