/* XenraAppDelegate */
"JIT is on." = "JIT 已启用。";
"This install has no get-task-allow, so iOS will refuse JIT. Reinstall with a development certificate, as SideStore, AltStore or Sideloadly use. Distribution certificates cannot carry it." = "此安装没有 get-task-allow，因此 iOS 会拒绝 JIT。请使用开发证书重新安装，例如 SideStore、AltStore 或 Sideloadly 所用的证书。分发证书无法包含它。";
"Waiting for JIT.\nEnable it for Xenra in StikDebug, then come back. The game starts by itself." = "正在等待 JIT。\n请在 StikDebug 中为 Xenra 启用，然后返回。游戏会自动开始。";

/* XenraLogs */
"Xenra crashed the last time it ran." = "Xenra 上次运行时崩溃了。";
"The last game did not exit cleanly. If you did not close it yourself, iOS ended it." = "上一款游戏没有正常退出。如果不是您自己关闭的，那就是被 iOS 结束了。";

/* XenraXemu */
"%@ cannot be read. It may have moved. Choose it again in the Setup Wizard." = "无法读取 %@。它可能已被移动。请在设置向导中重新选择。";
"%@ is not an MCPX boot ROM, which is exactly 512 bytes. Choose mcpx_1.0.bin in the Setup Wizard." = "%@ 不是 MCPX 启动 ROM，启动 ROM 正好为 512 字节。请在设置向导中选择 mcpx_1.0.bin。";

